  Persist availability before exposing the new active config.

  Lines 29-33 publish next before this write runs. Concurrent readers can
  therefore observe Network.Enabled changing while durable availability
  still has the previous value—or briefly observe a config later rolled back
  after a write failure.

  Stage dependency changes against next, persist the availability
  transition, then atomically publish the config. Any earlier side effects
  must be compensated if a later step fails.




